  "ruleText": "Tax 205.01 Applicability. This part, as well as Tax 201, and Tax 202, shall apply to land use change tax (LUCT) appeals.\n\nSource. #2256, eff 1-2-83; ss by #2943, eff 12-31-84; EXPIRED: 12-31-90\n\nNew. #5638, eff 9-1-93; ss by #7068, INTERIM, eff 8-15-99, EXPIRES, 12-13-99; ss by #7153, eff 12-10-99; ss by #7874-B, eff 4-18-03; ss by #8987-A, eff 9-24-07; ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10625-B, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23",
